WEBVTT

00:11:59.916 --> 00:12:02.956
Almost 45 percent, well, 45 percent.

00:12:03.636 --> 00:12:06.516
And how about,
you will need to be rescued?

00:12:06.556 --> 00:12:08.356
Thirty-one percent.

00:12:08.396 --> 00:12:11.396
I remember the first time
I saw this data, I was speechless.

00:12:11.396 --> 00:12:12.676
I was thinking,

00:12:12.676 --> 00:12:16.756
"Guys, if this is what you believe,
why would you ever leave home"

00:12:16.796 --> 00:12:17.956
you know?

00:12:17.996 --> 00:12:19.116
(Laughter)

00:12:20.876 --> 00:12:22.076
Yeah.

00:12:22.436 --> 00:12:27.236
Boarding an airplane
with no insurance is tempting fate.

00:12:27.876 --> 00:12:32.116
It's like realizing that your insurance
policy had just expired